Ord. 2517-25
Title 11 Fees Amendment
 
ORDINANCE No.____________
 
AN ORDINANCE AMENDING THE VILLAGE CODE OF THE VILLAGE OF HAWTHORN WOODS
–SECTION 11-1-1, FEES FOR CERTAIN ACTIVITIES AND PURPOSES
 
BE IT ORDAINED by the Mayor and Board of Trustees of the Village of Hawthorn
 
Woods, Lake County, Illinois, as follows:
 
SECTION ONE:   That Title 11, Section 11-1-1 of the Village Code of the Village
of Hawthorn Woods, entitled "FEES FOR CERTAIN ACTIVITIES AND PURPOSES", is
hereby deleted in its entirety and in lieu thereof, the following language
shall be substituted:
   …”The Village Board may, in its discretion, waive any fees and deposits that
are not otherwise legally required, and that are established in this chapter
for the benefit of any government entity or not-for-profit organizations,
except for deposits made to reimburse the Village for costs of professional,
architectural, planning, engineering and legal services, utility connection
fees and fees used to pay the Village’s out-of-pocket costs, including, but not
limited to publication costs, fees for the services of a court reporter, plan
reviews and building inspection fees. Where an ordinance or resolution of the
village licenses, regulates or otherwise governs a particular activity or
purpose, and a fee or charge is provided for in conjunction therewith, the
amount of such fee or charge shall be as follows:
 
