For purposes of this subsection, the terms "contractors" and "subcontractors"
shall include, but not be limited to: any person or company who undertakes to
construct, alter, improve, install, repair, remodel, rehabilitate, renovate or
move any land, house, building or other structure (of any kind or nature, whether
residential or not), or any fixture or any other item that is located on or in
the ground and/or attached to something that is located on or in the ground. No    
contractor registration under this activity shall be required of any person
performing any of the above defined work at or upon property owned by said
person, provided said person otherwise complies with all applicable provisions of
this Code. Notwithstanding the foregoing, no registration shall be required of
any contractor or subcontractor where prohibited by State law
