SECTION THREE:   That all ordinances and resolutions, or parts thereof, in
conflict with the provisions of the Ordinance are, to the extent of such
conflict, superseded by this Ordinance.
SECTION FOUR:   That this Ordinance shall be in full force and effect on
January 1, 2026.
